<title>USA: Central U.S. carlot pork at 1115 CDT - USDA.</title>
<headline>Central U.S. carlot pork at 1115 CDT - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fresh loins not fully established; butts not tested; sknd. hams 20-26 lbs. weak; sdls. bellies generally steady; lean trimmings 2.00 higher.</p>
<p>Trading slow, with light demand and mostly moderate</p>
<p>offerings. -USDA</p>
